<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day t-bill yield up, 91-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day t-bill yield up, 91-day down.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills rose to 26.60 percent on Tuesday from 21.20 percent at the previous auction on November 26, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 26.51 percent annual from 27.88 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Dec 3	   Nov 26</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   4.00 million lei  3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 3.69 million	6.01 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    3.64 million	3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    26.60 pct     21.20 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.0 pct	98.4 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  98.0-98.7 pct 98.4-99.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Jan 2, 1997   Dec 26, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Dec 3	   Nov 26</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   12.00 million lei 12.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 16.26 million     10.09 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    12.00 million     10.09 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    26.51 pct     27.88 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    93.8 pct	93.5 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  93.8-97.5 pct 93.5-96.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 March 6, 1997 Feb 27, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
